      "params_digest": "02054d6e391a7dba",
      "query": "{\"content\": \"claude-baseline provided an excellent, thorough analysis. It correctly identified the base rate and used the risk-set figure, establishing a sound anchor. It synthesized the split and the call for response, but appropriately discounted them due to the historical treatment of anti-SLAPP petitions (citing previous denials including Gopher Media from the same term). By actively retrieving the BIO and reply, it identified forfeiture and vehicle issues, arriving at a well-calibrated 0.08 pro",
